OL,3,GNEWSASchool to reopen after 27-hour
OL,4,Ahouse siege arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village school is due to reopen after
OL,7,Fit was forced to evacuate during a
OL,8,F27-hour siege at a nearby house.
OL,10,FHopton Primary Academy closed on
OL,11,FWednesday morning when a 45-year-old
OL,12,Fbarricaded himself in a house on Coast
OL,13,FRoad, Hopton-on-Sea, near Great
OL,14,FYarmouth.
OL,16,FHe was arrested on Thursday and later
OL,17,Fcharged with communicating false
OL,18,Finformation in relation to an alleged
OL,19,Fbomb hoax, making threats to damage
OL,20,Fproperty and wasting police time.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
