OL,3,GNEWSASchool to reopen after 27-hour
OL,4,Ahouse siege arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe school, which remained closed for
OL,7,Fthe rest of the week, said it would
OL,8,Freopen on Monday and thanked children,
OL,9,Ffamilies and staff "for their patience,
OL,10,Funderstanding and unwavering support
OL,11,Fover the past few days".
